{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 34, "title": "PII Redaction Bench \u2014 edited-paced replay of actual outputs", "env": {"TERM": "xterm-256color"}}
[0, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HPII Redaction Bench\r\nWhat this project demonstrates\r\n\r\nThe baseline returns typed character spans. Redaction validates non-overlapping bounds. Evaluation uses exact span matches and reports false positives and misses, including known unsupported classes.\r\n"]
[10, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HPII Redaction Bench\r\nActual fixture demo output\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"mode\": \"fixture\",\r\n  \"python\": \"3.12.13\",\r\n  \"recorded_at\": \"2026-10-31T13:52:23.113308+00:00\",\r\n  \"elapsed_seconds\": 0.0003,\r\n  \"result\": {\r\n    \"examples\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"Email alex@example.test today.\",\r\n        \"redacted\": \"Email [EMAIL] today.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"Call +34 612 345 678 tomorrow.\",\r\n        \"redacted\": \"Call [PHONE] tomorrow.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"The owner is Alex Example.\",\r\n        \"redacted\": \"The owner is Alex Example.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"Ticket 123456 is closed.\",\r\n        \"redacted\": \"Ticket 123456 is closed.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"Write sam.demo@example.test or billing@example.test.\",\r\n        \"redacted\": \"Write [EMAIL] or [EMAIL].\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"No personal data in this sentence.\",\r\n        \"redacted\": \"No personal data in this sentence.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"text\": \"Email alex [at] example [dot] test.\",\r\n        \"redacted\": \"Email alex [at] example [dot] test.\"\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"evaluation\": {\r\n      \"passed\": true,\r\n      \"metrics\": {\r\n        \"precision\": 1.0,\r\n        \"recall\": 0.6666666666666666,\r\n        \"true_positives\": 4,\r\n        \"false_positives\": 0,\r\n        \"false_negatives\": 2,\r\n        \"errors\": [\r\n          {\r\n            \"id\": \"3\",\r\n            \"false_positives\": [],\r\n            \"misses\": [\r\n              [\r\n                \"NAME\",\r\n                13,\r\n                25\r\n              ]\r\n            ],\r\n            \"redacted\": \"The owner is Alex Example.\"\r\n          },\r\n          {\r\n            \"id\": \"7\",\r\n            \"false_positives\": [],\r\n            \"misses\": [\r\n              [\r\n                \"EMAIL\",\r\n                6,\r\n                34\r\n              ]\r\n            ],\r\n            \"redacted\": \"Email alex [at] example [dot] test.\"\r\n          }\r\n        ]\r\n      },\r\n      \"case_count\": 7,\r\n      \"limitation\": \"Baseline recognizes formatted emails and one international phone shape. It intentionally misses names and obfuscated email. Not an anonymization guarantee.\"\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n"]
[20, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HPII Redaction Bench\r\nBehavior under test\r\n\r\n....                                                                     [100%]\r\n4 passed in 0.00s"]
[30, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HPII Redaction Bench\r\nMeasured evaluation / fixture mode\r\n\r\n{\r\n  \"passed\": true,\r\n  \"metrics\": {\r\n    \"precision\": 1.0,\r\n    \"recall\": 0.6666666666666666,\r\n    \"true_positives\": 4,\r\n    \"false_positives\": 0,\r\n    \"false_negatives\": 2,\r\n    \"errors\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"3\",\r\n        \"false_positives\": [],\r\n        \"misses\": [\r\n          [\r\n            \"NAME\",\r\n            13,\r\n            25\r\n          ]\r\n        ],\r\n        \"redacted\": \"The owner is Alex Example.\"\r\n      },\r\n      {\r\n        \"id\": \"7\",\r\n        \"false_positives\": [],\r\n        \"misses\": [\r\n          [\r\n            \"EMAIL\",\r\n            6,\r\n            34\r\n          ]\r\n        ],\r\n        \"redacted\": \"Email alex [at] example [dot] test.\"\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"case_count\": 7,\r\n  \"limitation\": \"Baseline recognizes formatted emails and one international phone shape. It intentionally misses names and obfuscated email. Not an anonymization guarantee.\"\r\n}"]
[40, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HPII Redaction Bench\r\nTradeoffs to explain at interview\r\n\r\nRegex support is intentionally limited to formatted emails and one phone pattern. This is not certified anonymization and must not be used as a privacy guarantee. All examples are synthetic.\r\n"]
[50, "o", "\u001b[2J\u001b[HPII Redaction Bench\r\nRun it yourself\r\n\r\ngit clone https://github.com/danielpdev/pii-redaction-bench.git\r\ncd pii-redaction-bench\r\nmake setup\r\nmake demo\r\nmake test\r\nmake eval\r\n\r\nSee README.md and docs/INTERVIEW_RO.md.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted portfolio project. Synthetic data.\r\nNo production customer claims."]
